text.zh:
我们想得到一个只含 \(E\) 的规律，所以对第一式再求一次时间变化率，并用第二式替换其中的 \(\partial B/\partial t\)。对平滑变化的场，先比较相邻时刻再比较相邻位置，与反过来做得到同样结果，允许交换这两个求变化率的次序：
\[\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2E}{\partial t^2}
&=-c\frac{\partial}{\partial x}
   \left(\frac{\partial B}{\partial t}\right)\\
&=-c\frac{\partial}{\partial x}
   \left(-c\frac{\partial E}{\partial x}\right)\\
&=c^2\frac{\partial^2E}{\partial x^2}.
\end{aligned}\]
左边是电场的时间变化率本身怎样改变，右边是电场波形在空间中如何弯曲，乘上 \(c^2\)。这类把时间变化与波形弯曲联系起来的规律，就是波动方程。

text.en:
To obtain a law involving only \(E\), take the time-change rate of the first equation once more, then substitute the second equation for \(\partial B/\partial t\). For smooth fields, comparing nearby times and then nearby positions gives the same result as reversing that order. This permits the two derivatives to be interchanged:
\[\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2E}{\partial t^2}
&=-c\frac{\partial}{\partial x}
   \left(\frac{\partial B}{\partial t}\right)\\
&=-c\frac{\partial}{\partial x}
   \left(-c\frac{\partial E}{\partial x}\right)\\
&=c^2\frac{\partial^2E}{\partial x^2}.
\end{aligned}\]
The left side describes how the field's rate of change itself changes with time; the right side describes the spatial curvature of its shape, multiplied by \(c^2\). This relation is a wave equation.
